# Steam Games — requêtes de test
# Extension VS Code : REST Client
# Après POST /login, copier le JWT reçu dans @token.
# Pour PUT et DELETE, remplacer @gameId par l'identifiant du jeu à modifier.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082/api/v1
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdGVhbS1nYW1lcyIsInN1YiI6IjQiLCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NjA1NTUsImlhdCI6MTc5MzU1Njk1NX0.HwHt15W45Q6H6fb6zb0UISoLItesV-cWey-Hnj2jE3Y
@gameId = 10

### Santé de l'API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Inscription (à effectuer une seule fois par email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patriqueRodriguez@gamil.com",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

### Connexion : récupérer le JWT dans la réponse
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patriqueRodriguez@gamil.com",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

### Mon profil (JWT requis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tous les utilisateurs (ADMIN requis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Liste des jeux : pagination et tri
GET {{baseUrl}}/games?limit=10&skip=0&ordering=title

### Liste des jeux : exemple de recherche
GET {{baseUrl}}/games?limit=10&skip=0&title=Counter-Strike

### Jeu par identifiant
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/{{gameId}}

### Créer un jeu (ADMIN requis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/games
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Snaptrack",
  "required_age": "17+",
  "is_free": false,
  "description": "Jeu de voiture fun entre amis",
  "price": 999.99,
  "developers": ["SnapInc"],
  "publishers": ["SnapInc"],
  "platforms": ["Windows", "Linux"],
  "genres": [
    { "id": 9, "description": "Racing" },
    { "id": 28, "description": "Simulation" },
    { "id": 1, "description": "Action" }
  ],
  "categories": [
    { "id": 1, "description": "Multi-player" },
    { "id": 47, "description": "LAN PvP" }
  ]
}

### Remplacer un jeu existant (ADMIN requis)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/games/{{gameId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Snaptrack",
  "required_age": "12",
  "is_free": false,
  "description": "Jeu de voiture fun entre amis",
  "price": 999.99,
  "developers": ["SnapInc"],
  "publishers": ["SnapInc"],
  "platforms": ["Windows", "Linux"],
  "genres": [
    { "id": 9, "description": "Racing" },
    { "id": 28, "description": "Simulation" },
    { "id": 1, "description": "Action" }
  ],
  "categories": [
    { "id": 1, "description": "Multi-player" },
    { "id": 47, "description": "LAN PvP" }
  ]
}

### Supprimer un jeu (ADMIN requis) — ATTENTION : suppression définitive
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/games/{{gameId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
